2026-11-19  SpeexDSP contributors

	Double-talk aware acoustic echo cancellation:
	* libspeexdsp/mdf.c: add an explicit double-talk detector combining a
	  normalized mic/echo cross-correlation with a Geigel power ratio, gated
	  by an entry/exit confirmation state machine; scale the adaptive filter
	  step down (to a configurable floor) while double-talk is detected.
	* libspeexdsp/preprocess.c: relax residual echo suppression and stop the
	  residual-echo max-hold during double-talk so near-end speech survives.
	* include/speex/speex_echo.h, include/speex/speex_preprocess.h: new
	  double-talk query and suppression control requests.
	* libspeexdsp/testecho_dtd_gen.c, libspeexdsp/testecho_dtd.c: synthetic
	  test audio generator and ERLE/preservation/DTD accuracy test.

